content.text:
I built the demo with Tandem and it passed all of Tandem's checks. It's four files (`index.html`, `engine3d.js`, `scene.js`, `app.js`) with no outside libraries: just open `index.html` in a browser.

The checks ran in a headless browser and confirmed:
- the canvas is animating;
- the counts are right: 180 stars, 110 particles, 6 crystals, 36 box faces and 48 crystal triangles;
- the FPS/POLYS/PARTS readouts appear and show values;
- the Pause, Orbit and Reset buttons and the speed slider change the state correctly.

I didn't look at the result myself, so the look of the scene (colors, glow, glass panel) hasn't been checked by eye.

